{"transcript":"si.jɔ.nɑ̃","exists":true,"definitions":["Qui trace des sillons.","Qui parcourt en tous sens, en laissant une trace.","Qui creuse des rides, des marques."],"examples":["Les tracteurs sillonnant les champs.","Les bateaux sillonnant les mers.","Les rides sillonnant son visage."],"lemma":"sillonner","lemmaPos":"verb","synonyms":["tracer","parcourir","creuser"],"number":"singular","tense":"present","pastTenses":"il a sillonné, il sillonna","source":"sillonnant"}